sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Caller Process<br/>(Notebook / Job Pod)
    participant Registry as AlgorithmRegistry
    participant Algorithm as Algorithm Subclass
    participant Backend as Backend Implementation

    Note over Caller,Backend: Flow 1: Training Execution (SFT / LoRA / GRPO)

    Caller->>Registry: sft() / lora_grpo() / gepa()
    Registry->>Algorithm: dispatch to registered Algorithm
    Algorithm->>Backend: delegate execution

    alt SFT via InstructLab Training
        Backend->>Backend: Launch torchrun workers<br/>(distributed SFT)
        Backend-->>Algorithm: Checkpoints + metrics
    else OSFT via Mini-Trainer
        Backend->>Backend: Execute mini-trainer<br/>(optimized SFT)
        Backend-->>Algorithm: Checkpoints + metrics
    else LoRA via Unsloth
        Backend->>Backend: In-process LoRA<br/>(memory-efficient)
        Backend-->>Algorithm: Adapter weights
    else GRPO via ART
        participant vLLM as vLLM Inference<br/>(Co-located GPU)
        Backend->>vLLM: Manage co-located inference<br/>(time-shared GPU)
        vLLM-->>Backend: Reward signals
        Backend-->>Algorithm: Trained model
    else GRPO via VeRL
        Backend->>Backend: Multi-node distributed<br/>GRPO execution
        Backend-->>Algorithm: Trained model
    end

    Algorithm-->>Registry: Results
    Registry-->>Caller: Checkpoints / metrics / optimized prompts

    Note over Caller,Backend: Flow 2: GEPA Inference (Prompt Optimization)

    participant LLM as OpenAI-compatible<br/>LLM Endpoint

    Caller->>Registry: gepa()
    Registry->>Algorithm: dispatch GEPA Algorithm
    Algorithm->>Algorithm: Set OPENAI_API_BASE,<br/>OPENAI_API_KEY env vars
    Algorithm->>Backend: delegate to GEPA Backend

    Backend->>LLM: HTTP POST inference request<br/>(via litellm)
    LLM-->>Backend: LLM response
    Note over Backend,LLM: Iterative optimization loop

    Backend-->>Algorithm: Optimized prompts
    Algorithm->>Algorithm: Restore original env vars
    Algorithm-->>Caller: Optimized prompts

    Note over Caller,Backend: Flow 3: MLflow Tracking (Optional)

    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking<br/>Server

    Caller->>Registry: gepa() with MLflow backend
    Registry->>Algorithm: dispatch GEPA Algorithm
    Algorithm->>Backend: delegate to MLflowGEPABackend

    Backend->>MLflow: mlflow.genai.optimize_prompts()<br/>(HTTP via mlflow SDK)
    MLflow-->>Backend: Experiment results +<br/>prompt registry entries
    Backend-->>Caller: Optimized prompts + experiment IDs
